Description:
Set on a tree-lined, river bank terrace just a short walk along the river bank from the city centre of Inverness, the Glenmoriston Town House Hotel is within easy travelling distance of Loch Ness, the Isle of Skye, Culloden Battlefield and many other attractions in the Scottish Highlands.
We accommodate groups, FIT and bespoke tours offering:
30 bedrooms and three apartments on-site; 
award-winning restaurant; 
Piano Bar with 260 malts, 60 gins and live music on weekends; 
Car and coach parking.
